          "name": "GitHub Get the Hourly Commit Count for Each Day",
          "request": {
            "name": "GitHub Get the Hourly Commit Count for Each Day",
            "description": {
              "content": "Each array contains the day number, hour number, and number of commits:\n\n*   `0-6`: Sunday - Saturday\n*   `0-23`: Hour of day\n*   Number of commits\n\nFor example, `[2, 14, 25]` indicates that there were 25 total commits, during the 2:00pm hour on Tuesdays. All times are based on the time zone of individual commits.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
